# The perf ledger (docs/perf/ledger.md) cites the raw benchmark outputs in
# */results/ as the evidence for its numbers, so they must be committed. A
# common global excludes rule, bench*.txt, silently kept bench-L.txt and
# bench-M.txt out of the repository once; re-include them here.
!bench*.txt
# The root .gitignore's scratch benchstat input stays ignored.
bench.txt
